+      * paged -- a region is one ``(page, head)`` pair covering ``page_size``
+        tokens (``src/sm100/fwd/atten_fwd_nvfp4_kv.py::_scale_region_base``).
+      * flat -- a region is ``R`` consecutive global tokens of a single KV
