+        ``R = 4`` for ``"swizzle4x4"``
+        (``..._scale_region_base_flat``).  ``R = 4`` requires
+        ``total_k % 4 == 0``.  Flat is a test-only geometry with no production
+        producer, so it is not an ABI.
